<title>JAPAN: Daewoo Securities Tokyo branch becomes JSDA member.</title>
<headline>Daewoo Securities Tokyo branch becomes JSDA member.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Japan Securities Dealers' Association (JSDA) said on Wednesday it had accepted Daewoo Securities Co's Tokyo branch as an association member.</p>
<p>The South Korean brokerage's unit obtained a licence to engage in the brokerage business in Japan on September 6, the JSDA said.</p>
<p>The number of foreign brokerages in the association has increased to 55, it added.</p>
</text>
